/ActualText (About me\nProduct Designer with 8 years of experience, including 5 years focused on B2B and enterprise products. Experienced in taking ambiguous problems from discovery to shipped experiences across complex workflows, data-heavy products, and 0\2221 initiatives. Strong in product thinking, user research, interaction design, prototyping, and cross-functional collaboration.)
