/ActualText (UI Designer - Yellowchalk UI/UX Design Studio\nOct 2017 - Jun 2020\nDesigned responsive web and mobile experiences for enterprise clients including Pramata and TeamLease.\n Conducted user research and feedback analysis to identify usability issues and inform interaction decisions.\n Collaborated with product, UX, and engineering teams from wireframes through implementation.\n Developed reusable UI patterns and design guidelines across projects.)
